04193f" class="r-gzgkys"><div data-rid="736c904e-971c-4f8d-bbd5-88e5c1c41d08" class="r-1g9c18l"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-4bc4b4" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 7.293l2.646-2.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708L8.707 8l2.647 2.646a.5.5 0 0 1-.708.708L8 8.707l-2.646 2.647a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708L7.293 8 4.646 5.354a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div><div data-rid="a65d138f-b1d0-46d3-bd2f-574efa4cde10" class="r-rapigk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>100% chance your girlfriend will ask why you’re still using the same products from high school&nbsp;</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="9d296403-47bf-46a4-88a9-4c259e8de54f" class="r-1nt7423"><div data-rid="fa086597-cfbf-4527-beec-1656c052ac90" class="r-9qgtfg"><picture data-rid="051bc913-d534-4af0-ad2a-2a6075c71b31" class="r-1003mg7"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0771/0860/9337/files/dr_2.png?v=1712828650&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0771/0860/9337/files/dr_2.png?v=1712828650&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0771/0860/9337/files/dr_2.png?v=1712828650&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0771/0860/9337/files/dr_2.png?v=1712828650" class="r-xzo8ko" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="005fabbc-a03c-4552-aaae-b67b8b83fb92" class="r-1aqmoz5"><div data-rid="8477ce63-d361-4fd7-b594-6b09bda48fc2" class="r-mresyw alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>It all Started with One Courageous Squatch&nbsp;</p></span></div><div data-rid="7e9a2506-9c99-43fd-87d6-08238d532f4b" class="r-1nmr4af alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Well, technically it started with our founder, Jack. He created natural soap in his garage and realized there were other guys seeking quality products with natural ingredients and manly scents. And so, Dr. Squatch was born! We're on a mission to raise the bar for natural products and change the way men approach personal care.&nbsp;</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="c69a71c0-d62e-4227-a6b4-2aed255a3e0c" class="r-1xgm7vj"><div data-rid="dd76241b-0d80-4683-883b-868b2a230718" class="r-1ma7i3"><div data-rid="e107dfe0-85e8-47ca-bd1d-1ea582b7fe7c" class="r-1jlb0u1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Doc's Office</p></span></div><div data-rid="b8c4fa2c-9a58-42f3-b118-c6733170bed4" class="r-ahx85h alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>You’ve got questions, we’ve got answers.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="52374069-a189-41f8-a9c3-e2af96d40205" class="r-kxuv1l"><div data-rid="4cb876ef-af35-4e0c-9662-67916e404c31" class="r-bfjw32" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="78366fa4-e703-4700-82e8-014a27c3e88f" class="r-bv224v" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="fb7a05b9-efd6-4b95-9ef6-c06e4ef79bd3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R1qr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1iisrxp"><div data-rid="23b5f1dc-d89b-44f1-8405-72f2a589afaa" class="r-1ukwfmp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What ingredients are in your products?</p></span></div><div data-rid="c2287c2f-6b4e-4c3c-8662-4bd3de62af29" class="r-dfychg"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-g90sag" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R1qr2:"><div data-rid="99267956-fceb-4df9-ad65-d603c8c879e0" class="r-1ucdr3m"><div data-rid="0a81d02f-0709-423b-ba7a-6801847bf381" class="r-vs48v7 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Glad you asked! We want Squatch Nation to be educated on the ingredients that are in our personal hygiene products so we have made an ingredient glossary just for this reason. If you go to the footer of our website, you can find the glossary which details all the natural ingredients you can find in your beloved Dr. Squatch products!</p><p><br>Our ingredient glossary is here to help you understand how Dr. Squatch products help take your hygiene game to the next level. The glossary describes all of the finest ingredients nature has to offer and tells you all about which ingredients are in specific products, as well as information about their purposes and/or any benefits they may serve.</p><p><br>For our Limited Edition bar soap ingredients click here!<br></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="45d315d4-2e00-4c40-807d-54fdabe15c1d" class="r-qptzfv" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="5034232f-c8bc-4f18-92df-5609898d28c6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R2qr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1p61r7p"><div data-rid="43ba10ce-bd40-4409-9777-48a5577849d5" class="r-hed5fe alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Are your ingredients organic?</p></span></div><div data-rid="daa06111-9f08-4228-b094-01457612be39" class="r-hmlm9f"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-14unhq8" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R2qr2:"><div data-rid="87c58c7b-1c97-40b7-bb10-da89bfd0af5a" class="r-1t3z99t"><div data-rid="a79887c7-3303-4f81-bde0-f9cca04b413b" class="r-1qx3n2v alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Although we are not certified organic, we strive to source many of our essential oils from organic ingredients. If you have any questions about a specific product, feel free to shoot us an email at <a href="mailto:support@drsquatch.com">support@drsquatch.com</a> or fill out our contact form here!</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="71af6939-f6c2-4c88-80dd-3fb0ff280d99" class="r-s6d9gg" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="80aab63d-6672-4443-ace0-dc098574fc01" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3qr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1muoy9g"><div data-rid="714576ce-24a5-442a-8fd2-8e7752c47828" class="r-f68w9j alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Are your products vegan?</p></span></div><div data-rid="8dd2dd0f-b88b-49ef-b594-668f097636c3" class="r-bvy5zp"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1ljfdfo" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3qr2:"><div data-rid="56d0018d-58b4-4c85-bb99-df1f566a69f9" class="r-1noy3p2"><div data-rid="65b9edbe-8741-4d57-95d1-5f7b75d24ca3" class="r-6av5on alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most of our products are vegan. None of our soaps are made from tallow or any other animal fats. All other oils in our products are plant-based oils.</p><p><br>However, our Deep Sea Goat's Milk bar, Eucalyptus Greek Yogurt bar, Shampoo, Conditioner, and Deodorant contain animal byproducts for that extra oomph when you're looking for something that's even more nourishing and moisturizing.</p><p><br>Contact us if you have more specific questions about these products!<br></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="3f141e81-648f-4a37-9718-78528e2bf468" class="r-1o1liy1" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c3657989-80f4-42a5-836f-7547160f9493" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R4qr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-uaqg6n"><div data-rid="0d5bd4b5-8a06-4c2e-85e8-6143e10a3889" class="r-1adoam8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How long does a bar of soap last?</p></span></div><div data-rid="ee4ce287-dd48-47da-967c-416548e26347" class="r-ryhtvm"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1szxjei" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R4qr2:"><div data-rid="de7e5b24-fd4b-43ef-8680-b2e61a93b6be" class="r-gaxyki"><div data-rid="2c274c06-990e-4cf5-969f-d4f40c3d8d18" class="r-xhu9zo alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our soaps last 2-3 weeks on average with daily use. The longevity differs between households based on a variety of factors — the amount of lather, the amount of body hair, the frequency of use, and the water type. If you're looking to extend the life of your soap, we recommend the following three methods:</p><p><br>It's best to store your soap in a place that will allow it to dry out between uses — we recommend using a Dr. Squatch Soap Saver or Soap Gripper, which can usually double the life of our bars.</p><p><br>After showering, give your bar a little shake before storing it away on the Soap Saver, removing any excess water droplets.</p><p><br><br>Use a loofah or shower cloth to create your soap lather, rather than using the bar directly under constant running water. If you don't have a loofah, a cheap alternative is to use your man beard or any other body hair. A true Sasquatch may find that this might be the best way to lather up.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="d2d1ec69-76c7-4346-bfae-7ccbbb94ae75" class="r-hezrag" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="68aace90-9b71-4231-9e1d-8f8930b4671a" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5qr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-qv12al"><div data-rid="4084b524-5cc1-445a-aecf-dda7357bff9f" class="r-zso9wo alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Are your bars hypoallergenic?</p></span></div><div data-rid="e55f6c38-85b7-48a1-98ed-141c518e5f11" class="r-14m6wl4"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-8oa73y" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5qr2:"><div data-rid="1425efe1-ec04-4427-b738-93ab167a249c" class="r-1jqlw56"><div data-rid="cd5098e3-7a7e-4adc-8096-ffa9542f1981" class="r-u7yyx0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>While our bars are not formulated to be hypoallergenic, we've had many customers with sensitive skin report positive results when using our soap!<br><br>If you have sensitive skin, we recommend checking out the Deep Sea Goat’s Milk, Eucalyptus Greek Yogurt, or Cool Fresh Aloe bars.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="45f79ffb-2047-4be7-8358-037093623023" class="r-1tfdf3y" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="8bd2711f-a615-4d40-8c67-abc7ba28130c" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R6qr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-ci4rkh"><div data-rid="724bdee1-9308-41b5-a803-c9747bba67e0" class="r-9mg1wi alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What ingredients are in your products?</p></span></div><div data-rid="0fa5d0a2-c235-450c-ae83-84d7ae591e06" class="r-roxgwv"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-18ekw95" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R6qr2:"><div data-rid="13765eeb-5704-45c0-8fce-4ed4970f5f9b" class="r-5xgqx8"><div data-rid="5c9057e3-9e34-4c9b-a02d-16777239f531" class="r-smye3o alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Great question! While our soaps are not formulated to be antibacterial, research shows that normal soap (like our cold-processed, all-natural soap) is as effective as antibacterial soap in preventing infectious illness and keeping good hygiene.</p><p><br>Most soaps that are branded as antibacterial contain triclosan, an ingredient found in a variety of body soaps, cleaning products, and toothpastes. Triclosan is thought to be a likely contributor to the development of antibacterial and antibiotic resistance, as well as damaging to the environment!</p><p>If you’re looking to stay clean, stick with normal soap!<br></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="038797fc-8f2f-468d-bbb9-9f65603dd134" class="r-1vzf0xk" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="b3e9a6d3-bf98-4f9a-b308-6ac4391f3df4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7qr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-uamfts"><div data-rid="ea04db2a-46d9-4030-98bb-4ed071486ece" class="r-ubln1h alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I use the soap bars on my hair and face?</p></span></div><div data-rid="10947fdc-ac1a-4965-bc37-b27a5cd37c39" class="r-1i2i3hj"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-29rnut" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R7qr2:"><div data-rid="64840b01-4a08-48c3-a4e2-52e3db23d792" class="r-1fs38bd"><div data-rid="8806c49c-13fc-4eef-bad0-7a36749bdf27" class="r-14afbw1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our soap ingredients are natural and safe for skin and hair. All of our bars can be used on the face however, we recommend using a zero grit bar when applying to the face. While our bars are not formulated or guaranteed to fight against acne, assist psoriasis, or relieve eczema, some of our members have reported positive results. Check out our favorite bars for daily use here.</p><p><br>Although our bars can be used on hair and face, we also offer hair care products that are specially formulated to provide a variety of benefits specifically for one's hair and scalp. Check out our hair care products here.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b54693f4-7ac4-4440-9e7a-7755548f92f1" class="r-1smyyg1" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="bfe7075a-5055-4355-986b-8b81fc5c0c2b" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R8qr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1hunk3g"><div data-rid="848b7dfc-d010-4ca8-a6e1-bcc58d1d407d" class="r-fm32ve alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Do you test your products on animals?</p></span></div><div data-rid="a18d2796-7b64-41f5-98e9-2e4d9cd5bd40" class="r-9ji03u"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1u0yp82" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R8qr2:"><div data-rid="f28ce4f8-db57-4ede-9b77-50db3fed9604" class="r-3likd9"><div data-rid="e8a618c0-6432-4834-bab9-22a251725a22" class="r-acxw3l alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Only the interns in our office — no animals (or squatches), though! Here at Dr. Squatch, while we are not certified cruelty-free, we love our furry friends and would never test any of our products on them.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="09755a61-5c7f-43d8-9ffc-12897139f8a0" class="r-1oekk91" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="4694d509-f42c-4125-ad64-6d13f532dd42" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9qr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-nr899z"><div data-rid="3d231896-7c38-44a8-85d0-8503847e86b2" class="r-16t2n9d alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Where are your products made?</p></span></div><div data-rid="d7199c09-cb79-4fd0-a8cb-e1a0637db2db" class="r-ongxn"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-w6j7sa" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R9qr2:"><div data-rid="12518545-dfa5-483e-a41b-e6b7d428cbfe" class="r-1v6t2ac"><div data-rid="b3e420ea-3674-42f2-bbb2-986591d0f6c0" class="r-11lkbgd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>All of our products are proudly made in the USA.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="5bc6c48c-0d99-4e78-